We tried the VM tuning recommended in the attachment v40d-tune.html of =
http://groups.google.de/group/fa.alpha-osf-managers/msg/6fc7d8d1ac927a1d =
. However, this did not fix the problem of netisr.

I can provide /etc/sysconfigtab if it helps - we have increased the TCP =
and UDP send and receive spaces, among others.

Looking forward to any suggestions,
